From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Ross <jonross@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:10:12 -0700
Subject: Harden RenderWidgetHostViewEventHandler::FinishImeCompositionSession

FinishImeCompositionSession() on mouse press and gesture tap during
active IME composition is re-entrant to OS input methods.

These synchronous callouts can pump messages or cause focus changes that
re-entrantly destroy the view or its window.

Bug: 561891645
Change-Id: Ide2361ce3be241bba1debc08930089c6092e1738
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8443460
Commit-Queue: Jonathan Ross <jonross@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Kartar Singh <kartarsingh@google.com>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1706078}

diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_view_aura_unittest.cc b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_view_aura_unittest.cc
index a07db58c06e4130ed701e167f27acc807ee58cf8..7e276aa48eab2f8f52f7d16b1695b6144f25972c 100644
--- a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_widget_host_view_aura_unittest.cc
